  "input": "Which note corrected the recorded owner of reporting, and when?\n[2025-04-08] standup/dune/2025-04-08: Reminder that the reporting service depends on the ledger. [2025-11-17] handover/2025-11-17-reporting-correction: The 2025-11-07 note about the reporting service named the wrong team. The Ember team took it over on that date; team Boreal did not. [2025-07-04] handover/2025-07-04-webhooks-correction: Fixing an error in the 2025-06-20 handover: the new owner of the webhooks service is Dune. Ember was recorded by mistake and never held it.",
